1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Anders Andersson Konst in Tornio got the name from the house named Konst when he became the owner if this house in Tornio. It is not his birth name. His father-in-law was Olof Persson Konst - the former owner of th
2 CONC e Konst house and his wife Karin is Olof's daughter. It is highly unlikely that his fathers name was Konst and it is clear that based on his age he was not a soldier in 1639 in Skellefteå. Also the proof for the existence of broth
2 CONC ers Pehr and Olof is missing. Olof Konst in Tornio was not his brother. He was Olof Persson. For sources see Anders Andersson Konst.
