2 SURN Kleen
1 NAME Else Kleen-Möller
1 NAME Else /Kleen/
2 GIVN Else
2 SURN Kleen
1 SEX F
1 BURI
2 ADDR
3 CTRY Sweden
1 BIRT
2 DATE 26 FEB 1882
